{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"The `control_query` command orchestrates an AI-driven code editing session by constructing a dynamic system prompt that incorporates available MCP tools, current file context, and chat history. It iteratively queries an LLM to generate responses, automatically parsing and executing tool calls (such as file operations) when requested until a final answer is produced. The command returns the LLM's generated text response as a string, enabling intelligent assistance for editing control logic within the Newbound IDE.","import":"use ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse flowlang::mcp::mcp::list_tools::list_tools;\nuse flowlang::mcp::mcp::invoke::invoke;\nuse std::collections::HashSet;\nuse ndata::Data::DString;\nuse crate::agent::llm::tool_loop::tool_loop;\n","params":[{"name":"message","type":"String"},{"name":"context","type":"JSONObject"}],"returntype":"String","type":"rust"},"id":"innxiu19ebbb8efe6yfdf","readers":[],"time":1784419394658,"username":"system","writers":[]}